{"version":1,"content":"<p>索尼正式發佈小型空間再現顯示器ELF-MN1，產品採用6英寸面板，無需特殊眼鏡或頭戴設備即可觀看虛擬角色、數字分身等立體內容。該設備計劃於12月11日在日本上市，預計市場售價約為5.4萬日元。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584202.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:41:09.628382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:28:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T15:38:16.530565+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:38:16.530565+00:00","content_hash":"db023573794870fc6d82e50460d5998661a39abd0f5a41376bec04d5d63b8de3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}